title: 'pallet-validator-collators: configurable default for MaxCollators'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `pallet-validator-collators` has a new config item `DefaultMaxCollators`, the value of
    `MaxCollators` until governance sets it. `None` is no cap.

    Asset Hub Westend and People Westend default to a cap of 0, so validators contribute no
    collators until governance raises the cap.
crates:
- name: pallet-validator-collators
  # New required `DefaultMaxCollators` config item and `MaxCollators` changes storage type.
  bump: major
  validate: false
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: minor
- name: people-westend-runtime
  bump: minor
- name: pallet-validator-set-announcer
  bump: none
- name: people-westend-integration-tests
  bump: none
- name: cumulus-zombienet-sdk-tests
  bump: none
